1
00:00:26,359 --> 00:00:27,193
<font color="white">Bun-hong.</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:28,737
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,113
<font color="white">Where is Yun?</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,198
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:33,700
<font color="white">The thing is…</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:51,509 --> 00:00:53,928
<font color="white">Thank you all for your trouble today.</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:50,527 --> 00:01:52,320
<font color="white">Won, you have grown into a fine young man.</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:54,781
<font color="white">Thank you, Uncle.</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:56,116 --> 00:01:57,408
<font color="white">I trust you have been well.</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:57,492 --> 00:02:00,286
<font color="white">Indeed. Look at you,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you have come along admirably!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

11
00:02:02,539 --> 00:02:03,373
<font color="white">Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:03,456 --> 00:02:08,002
<font color="white">I have set aside a new weasel-hair brush</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">made from black bamboo for the elder.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

13
00:02:08,086 --> 00:02:10,630
<font color="white">Would you go</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to the study annex and fetch it?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

14
00:02:11,589 --> 00:02:12,423
<font color="white">That will do.</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:12,507 --> 00:02:14,634
<font color="white">Yes, certainly.</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:03:00,263 --> 00:03:02,307
<font color="white">You are not meant to come in here.</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:03:04,392 --> 00:03:05,643
<font color="white">I might say the same of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:05,727 --> 00:03:09,272
<font color="white">How dare a young woman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">behave as such in my uncle's study annex?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

19
00:03:12,525 --> 00:03:14,444
<font color="white">Won, it is you.</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:15,403 --> 00:03:16,529
<font color="white">Cousin Yun?</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:19,657
<font color="white">You have grown into quite the man.</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:19,741 --> 00:03:21,242
<font color="white">I almost did not recognize you.</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:29,417 --> 00:03:31,586
<font color="white">Good heavens! The brush!</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:31,669 --> 00:03:33,713
<font color="white">Uncle sent me to fetch it!</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:33,796 --> 00:03:35,548
<font color="white">How could you have used it?</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:35,632 --> 00:03:37,842
<font color="white">It is a brush,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">meant to be used by someone in time.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

27
00:03:38,635 --> 00:03:39,802
<font color="white">What matter is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:42,805 --> 00:03:46,434
<font color="white">He laughed so heartily</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it quite took me aback.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

29
00:03:51,147 --> 00:03:52,357
<font color="white">He has brought it.</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,900
<font color="white">Is that the brush?</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:59,489 --> 00:04:01,616
<font color="white">Won, did you use the brush?</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:01,699 --> 00:04:03,952
<font color="white">Surely he would not be so ill-mannered.</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:04,035 --> 00:04:06,496
<font color="white">Won, speak for yourself.</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:07,413 --> 00:04:08,665
<font color="white">But that is not…</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:08,748 --> 00:04:09,916
<font color="white">Well, let us see</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:15,046
<font color="white">what Won has written here.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:17,465 --> 00:04:21,094
<font color="white">My word, did you truly write this?</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:21,886 --> 00:04:23,429
<font color="white">I would like to see it as well.</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:26,140
<font color="white">Goodness, brother. Do take a look.</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:26,224 --> 00:04:28,059
<font color="white">Here it is.</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:38,444
<font color="white">Well, well, the boy shows promise.</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:38,528 --> 00:04:42,573
<font color="white"><i>Expound the virtues that make tobacco</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>The southern sacred herb</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:42,657 --> 00:04:44,993
<font color="white"><i>A loyal subject</i></font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:45,076 --> 00:04:47,161
<font color="white"><i>As the topic is set</i></font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:47,245 --> 00:04:49,747
<font color="white"><i>The examination hall</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Becomes quite a spectacle</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:50,832 --> 00:04:52,542
<font color="white"><i>Now, whose son might this be?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:52,625 --> 00:04:55,461
<font color="white"><i>He has studied remarkably well</i></font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:55,545 --> 00:04:59,048
<font color="white"><i>I owe him for this handsome pay</i></font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:59,132 --> 00:05:02,969
<font color="white"><i>So what choice have I but to sing as bid?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:03,594 --> 00:05:06,764
<font color="white"><i>May you achieve top honors</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>In the civil service exam</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:06,848 --> 00:05:08,516
<font color="white">-Sir.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>Well, well</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:08,599 --> 00:05:13,062
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>One slips a few coins to the examiner</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-A small token.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

53
00:05:13,146 --> 00:05:16,566
<font color="white"><i>Another takes measure of the room</i></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:16,649 --> 00:05:20,111
<font color="white"><i>Still the neck stiffens, the head throbs</i></font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:20,903 --> 00:05:26,159
<font color="white"><i>Buy a discarded script if you will</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>What use is it?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:26,242 --> 00:05:28,703
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>This scholar copies on the sly</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Get him out of here!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

57
00:05:28,786 --> 00:05:30,872
<font color="white"><i>That one does not even trouble to hide it</i></font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:30,955 --> 00:05:32,498
<font color="white">-No, sir!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-You even copied his name.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

59
00:05:32,582 --> 00:05:37,587
<font color="white"><i>And that poor fellow</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>With neither wit nor luck</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:41,966
<font color="white"><i>Finds himself cast out of the hall</i></font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:42,050 --> 00:05:44,093
<font color="white"><i>When the hall is in an uproar</i></font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:44,177 --> 00:05:46,679
<font color="white"><i>At so strange a topic</i></font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:47,221 --> 00:05:52,518
<font color="white"><i>There he is, like a crane just alighted</i></font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:55,521 --> 00:05:57,732
<font color="white"><i>With calm eyes</i></font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:58,232 --> 00:06:02,028
<font color="white"><i>And a faint smile upon his lips</i></font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:03,654 --> 00:06:06,365
<font color="white"><i>His strokes</i></font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:06,449 --> 00:06:11,913
<font color="white"><i>Supple yet forceful</i></font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:11,996 --> 00:06:16,167
<font color="white"><i>Soar like a black dragon</i></font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:16,250 --> 00:06:18,920
<font color="white"><i>To the blue clouds</i></font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:20,213 --> 00:06:21,631
<font color="white"><i>Well, well</i></font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:21,714 --> 00:06:25,635
<font color="white"><i>Here he is</i></font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:25,718 --> 00:06:29,931
<font color="white"><i>Top honors in the civil service exam</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>The garlanded victor</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:31,015 --> 00:06:34,769
<font color="white"><i>Here he is</i></font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:35,353 --> 00:06:37,480
<font color="white">I was beside myself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with worry for that boy,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

75
00:06:37,563 --> 00:06:41,109
<font color="white">studying under his taciturn father.</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:41,192 --> 00:06:42,318
<font color="white">Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:42,401 --> 00:06:44,987
<font color="white">Surely you have</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at least one literary friend?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

78
00:06:45,071 --> 00:06:46,405
<font color="white">A friend with whom</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:46,489 --> 00:06:48,991
<font color="white">you exchange letters</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and share a friendship through words.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

80
00:06:51,786 --> 00:06:53,412
<font color="white">We will bring the table in.</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:55,915 --> 00:06:57,542
<font color="white">I am sure he has many.</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:57,625 --> 00:06:59,919
<font color="white">A lad so keen.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">If he has no literary friends,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

83
00:07:00,002 --> 00:07:02,171
<font color="white">that would be his father's fault,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">would it not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

84
00:07:03,798 --> 00:07:05,633
<font color="white">My apologies. I…</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:08,010 --> 00:07:11,347
<font color="white">His brilliance shone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the initial examination as well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

86
00:07:13,641 --> 00:07:17,103
<font color="white">Who could have foreseen</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a question on the virtues of tobacco?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

87
00:07:17,186 --> 00:07:18,479
<font color="white">Indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:19,689 --> 00:07:23,151
<font color="white">Won, let us hear your answer.</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:26,696 --> 00:07:29,907
<font color="white">With tobacco's bitter scent</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">filling the mouth,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

90
00:07:32,201 --> 00:07:34,620
<font color="white">one cannot utter what one would.</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:35,121 --> 00:07:36,581
<font color="white">Resentment rises,</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:36,664 --> 00:07:39,375
<font color="white">yet before it gathers,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">one exhales it with the smoke,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

93
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:40,877
<font color="white">letting it speak in one's stead.</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:41,461 --> 00:07:43,296
<font color="white">None hear it,</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:43,379 --> 00:07:45,381
<font color="white">thus one walks the path</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of a loyal subject.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

96
00:07:46,966 --> 00:07:50,011
<font color="white">Absolutely flawless, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:50,595 --> 00:07:52,680
<font color="white">In the palace examination,</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:52,763 --> 00:07:55,349
<font color="white">we may well expect him to take top honors.</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:55,433 --> 00:07:59,770
<font color="white">I owe it to my most worthy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and learned literary friend.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

100
00:07:59,854 --> 00:08:00,813
<font color="white">You imprudent boy!</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:08:00,897 --> 00:08:03,733
<font color="white">How can you credit your own brilliance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to your literary friend?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

102
00:08:03,816 --> 00:08:08,321
<font color="white">Were they so remarkable,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">their names would long since be known.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

103
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:13,910
<font color="white">Precisely.</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:16,621 --> 00:08:19,874
<font color="white">Have I ever been given the chance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for my name to be known?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

105
00:08:26,339 --> 00:08:30,843
<font color="white">Seeing this, it is plain</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Won takes after his father.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

106
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,651
<font color="white">The entire family's hopes</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">seem to rest on you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

107
00:08:46,734 --> 00:08:47,860
<font color="white">It is all thanks to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:48,486 --> 00:08:49,487
<font color="white">It is by your guidance</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:50,154 --> 00:08:53,449
<font color="white">that I have learned</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and come to know so much.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

110
00:09:12,176 --> 00:09:14,845
<font color="white">Miss Yun! Where are you?</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:15,346 --> 00:09:17,056
<font color="white">Your mother is looking for you!</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:17,682 --> 00:09:20,518
<font color="white"><i>No, you already had plenty of talent.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:09:21,185 --> 00:09:22,979
<font color="white"><i>I simply helped you see it.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:09:26,107 --> 00:09:28,901
<font color="white">Did I not tell you to stay</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by Yun's side at all times?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

115
00:09:29,694 --> 00:09:31,279
<font color="white">My apologies, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:09:31,362 --> 00:09:33,489
<font color="white">She disappeared all of a sudden.</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:10:27,043 --> 00:10:31,547
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:10:32,173 --> 00:10:34,925
<font color="white">They're honored to have their daughter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">taken to carry on your line,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

119
00:10:35,009 --> 00:10:36,844
<font color="white">but hearing she'd learn</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">letters and painting</font><font color="white"></font></font>

120
00:10:36,927 --> 00:10:38,471
<font color="white">under so virtuous a lady as yourself,</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:10:38,554 --> 00:10:40,806
<font color="white">the mother seemed ready</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to come along herself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

122
00:10:42,058 --> 00:10:43,225
<font color="white">As I said,</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:10:43,809 --> 00:10:46,562
<font color="white">of the two daughters, the elder</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">resembles her father and is well-bred,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

124
00:10:47,229 --> 00:10:50,608
<font color="white">but the younger takes after her mother</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and only has a knack for trade.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

125
00:10:52,026 --> 00:10:53,778
<font color="white">So it is the elder you should see.</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:11:00,618 --> 00:11:01,827
<font color="white">HARYANGGYO</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:11:01,911 --> 00:11:03,954
<font color="white">Silk for sale!</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:11:06,832 --> 00:11:08,793
<font color="white">Look at them, on all fours!</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:11:13,589 --> 00:11:15,424
<font color="white">Fine Qing silk!</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:11:16,050 --> 00:11:18,594
<font color="white">Ours is just the same! Madam, this way!</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:11:27,186 --> 00:11:30,022
<font color="white">We are most honored</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you have come in person.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

132
00:11:31,273 --> 00:11:33,401
<font color="white">I never thought</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'd have the honor of meeting you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

133
00:11:36,612 --> 00:11:38,864
<font color="white">Are all these the tobacco you sell?</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:11:38,948 --> 00:11:40,908
<font color="white">Oh, no, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:11:40,991 --> 00:11:43,452
<font color="white">The finer leaves</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for esteemed guests are kept aside.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

136
00:11:43,536 --> 00:11:46,455
<font color="white">These are rough and damp,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I've gathered them separately,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

137
00:11:46,539 --> 00:11:47,957
<font color="white">soon to be sent to Hwaseong.</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:11:49,166 --> 00:11:50,000
<font color="white">Hwaseong?</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:11:50,584 --> 00:11:53,796
<font color="white">They say His Majesty</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is undertaking something there,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

140
00:11:53,879 --> 00:11:55,881
<font color="white">and laborers from across the country</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have gathered.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

141
00:11:55,965 --> 00:11:57,591
<font color="white">And when such men gather,</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:11:57,675 --> 00:12:00,052
<font color="white">what else would they do</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but puff away like chimneys?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

143
00:12:00,136 --> 00:12:01,846
<font color="white">What was that fancy phrase again?</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:12:01,929 --> 00:12:03,305
<font color="white">Kill two birds with one stone.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:12:03,889 --> 00:12:05,099
<font color="white">Skilled two birds with a tone.</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:10,146
<font color="white">Madam, let me escort you inside.</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:12:10,229 --> 00:12:12,231
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">This way to the inner quarters, please.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

148
00:12:25,995 --> 00:12:28,497
<font color="white">As expected, you recognize it at once.</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:12:28,581 --> 00:12:29,832
<font color="white">It's quite worth the expense…</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:12:29,915 --> 00:12:32,543
<font color="white">I mean, I can hardly contain my joy.</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:12:33,043 --> 00:12:35,880
<font color="white">It is one of Shin Saimdang's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">plant-and-insect paintings.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

152
00:12:35,963 --> 00:12:37,965
<font color="white">Is it not truly exquisite?</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:12:42,928 --> 00:12:43,804
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:12:43,888 --> 00:12:47,725
<font color="white">Since it seems to interest you,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">there is something I would dare show you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

155
00:12:47,808 --> 00:12:50,352
<font color="white">Would you care to take a look?</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:13:07,203 --> 00:13:08,078
<font color="white">Might this be</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:13:09,413 --> 00:13:11,499
<font color="white">a work by Master Danwon?</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:13:11,582 --> 00:13:13,918
<font color="white">Yes, indeed!</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:13:14,001 --> 00:13:19,048
<font color="white">I have heard much</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of your discerning eye for art,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

160
00:13:19,131 --> 00:13:20,549
<font color="white">but to have you know it at once,</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:13:21,133 --> 00:13:22,760
<font color="white">I hardly know where to place myself.</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:13:27,306 --> 00:13:29,433
<font color="white">I look better in the flesh, do I not?</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:13:31,477 --> 00:13:32,353
<font color="white">No?</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,319
<font color="white">How is she?</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:13:52,164 --> 00:13:52,998
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:13:53,624 --> 00:13:56,377
<font color="white">she will likely</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have difficulty conceiving.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

167
00:14:00,214 --> 00:14:01,131
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:01,215 --> 00:14:02,049
<font color="white">Sure.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:14:03,425 --> 00:14:05,135
<font color="white">Oh, whatever do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:14:06,262 --> 00:14:09,807
<font color="white">The house shows uncommon taste throughout.</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:14:10,349 --> 00:14:11,308
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:14:11,392 --> 00:14:14,019
<font color="white">It is not merely a display of rare things.</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:14:14,103 --> 00:14:17,231
<font color="white">The harmony of its splendor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is a feast for the eyes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

174
00:14:18,524 --> 00:14:20,067
<font color="white">I found it most enjoyable.</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,193
<font color="white">Yes, well…</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:14:21,986 --> 00:14:24,154
<font color="white">Lowly as I am,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when I see something of value,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

177
00:14:24,238 --> 00:14:26,407
<font color="white">I cannot rest till I have it in my hands.</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:14:27,908 --> 00:14:29,535
<font color="white">Would you like Saimdang's painting?</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:14:29,618 --> 00:14:31,829
<font color="white">If you wish, I will offer it as a gift.</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:14:31,912 --> 00:14:33,664
<font color="white">Or shall I summon Master Danwon himself?</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:14:36,041 --> 00:14:38,043
<font color="white">It would have been a fine match,</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:14:38,961 --> 00:14:41,755
<font color="white">yet it seems beyond our reach</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to make such a tie.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

183
00:14:43,007 --> 00:14:45,092
<font color="white">Mother, I shall bring in the refreshments.</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:14:52,099 --> 00:14:54,184
<font color="white">Well, these are </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>juak</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

185
00:14:55,102 --> 00:14:56,729
<font color="white">Please enjoy, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:15:00,774 --> 00:15:01,859
<font color="white">What's the matter?</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:15:02,443 --> 00:15:03,861
<font color="white">They are really good.</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:15:07,281 --> 00:15:08,198
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:15:09,241 --> 00:15:10,075
<font color="white">What…</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:15:11,118 --> 00:15:12,161
<font color="white">Damn you.</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:23,589
<font color="white">It really is good.</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:15:35,851 --> 00:15:36,852
<font color="white">This time…</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:15:37,770 --> 00:15:39,730
<font color="white">There. I will place it here.</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:15:40,689 --> 00:15:41,815
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:16:01,251 --> 00:16:02,169
<font color="white">Let me see.</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:16:09,259 --> 00:16:11,303
<font color="white">He was playing until a moment ago,</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:16:11,971 --> 00:16:14,974
<font color="white">yet he fell asleep before his turn came.</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:16:15,057 --> 00:16:16,266
<font color="white">I tell you,</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:16:16,892 --> 00:16:19,186
<font color="white">he will be the greatest man in our family.</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:19,937 --> 00:16:22,481
<font color="white">It has already been six days.</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:26,276
<font color="white">It is time your nephew returned home.</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:28,654
<font color="white">Let him stay for four more days.</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:16:28,737 --> 00:16:31,281
<font color="white">A full ten days,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">then I shall have less regret.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

204
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:33,993
<font color="white">Do you like him that much?</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:16:36,912 --> 00:16:39,248
<font color="white">Is it not remarkable?</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:16:39,331 --> 00:16:42,251
<font color="white">Only a few years ago,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he would toss these stones about in play.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

207
00:16:42,793 --> 00:16:43,627
<font color="white">Now,</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:16:44,545 --> 00:16:46,547
<font color="white">he has become a most worthy opponent.</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:07,568 --> 00:17:08,444
<font color="white">There.</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:17:12,948 --> 00:17:13,824
<font color="white">Your arms.</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:21,665
<font color="white">You look absolutely lovely.</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:17:21,749 --> 00:17:24,334
<font color="white">When you get there, do nothing else.</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:17:24,418 --> 00:17:25,252
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:17:25,335 --> 00:17:27,504
<font color="white">Stand where the lord cannot miss you</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:17:27,588 --> 00:17:31,633
<font color="white">and simply say,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">"I have brought a gift for the lady."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

216
00:17:31,717 --> 00:17:32,593
<font color="white">And look at him</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:17:33,135 --> 00:17:34,344
<font color="white">like this.</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:17:35,512 --> 00:17:36,930
<font color="white">Like this.</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:17:37,014 --> 00:17:37,848
<font color="white">Try it.</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:17:39,266 --> 00:17:40,684
<font color="white">Like…</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:17:41,685 --> 00:17:43,270
<font color="white">Like this?</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:17:43,854 --> 00:17:47,066
<font color="white">Good! That's it!</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:19:04,476 --> 00:19:07,104
<font color="white">Well, who…</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:19:07,688 --> 00:19:08,605
<font color="white">Who are you?</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:19:09,606 --> 00:19:12,442
<font color="white">Well, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:19:36,425 --> 00:19:38,677
<font color="white">My lady, she…</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:19:55,611 --> 00:19:57,696
<font color="white">My mother told me to deliver this.</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:19:58,488 --> 00:20:01,074
<font color="white">She said it must be given today,</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:20:01,158 --> 00:20:02,868
<font color="white">so I have come in person.</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:20:06,872 --> 00:20:08,290
<font color="white">Soaked to the bone.</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:20:09,708 --> 00:20:11,001
<font color="white">How unseemly.</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:20:14,755 --> 00:20:17,716
<font color="white">Your mother sent you out in the rain</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:20:18,675 --> 00:20:20,469
<font color="white">without even an overcoat?</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:20:23,305 --> 00:20:26,266
<font color="white">Warm yourself,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and return home when the sun is up.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

235
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:28,310
<font color="white">And tell your mother</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:20:29,353 --> 00:20:31,271
<font color="white">that I commend her wit,</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:20:32,731 --> 00:20:34,233
<font color="white">but she has presumed too far.</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:20:35,234 --> 00:20:38,904
<font color="white">Gye-hwa, bring her dry clothes</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and some hot water.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

239
00:20:38,987 --> 00:20:39,863
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:20:52,918 --> 00:20:54,753
<font color="white">What a vulgar family.</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:20:55,254 --> 00:20:57,506
<font color="white">To send such a young girl out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for some trifling gift.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

242
00:20:59,049 --> 00:21:01,426
<font color="white">If she gets through the day,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she should be fine.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

243
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:03,637
<font color="white">It weighs on me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to see her laid up like this</font><font color="white"></font></font>

244
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,347
<font color="white">when she has come as a guest.</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:21:06,139 --> 00:21:07,516
<font color="white">See to her medicine with care.</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:21:07,599 --> 00:21:09,017
<font color="white">Yes, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:21:09,101 --> 00:21:10,602
<font color="white">Has she had anything to eat?</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:21:10,686 --> 00:21:14,398
<font color="white">Yes, the madam</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">had porridge prepared for her.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

249
00:21:14,481 --> 00:21:16,441
<font color="white">Porridge alone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">will not do for one so young.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

250
00:21:19,403 --> 00:21:20,779
<font color="white">-Here, take this.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

251
00:21:23,699 --> 00:21:26,285
<font color="white">Thank you, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:22:07,367 --> 00:22:09,911
<font color="white">That patch over there has sunk again.</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:22:11,413 --> 00:22:12,539
<font color="white">Give it some water.</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:22:31,183 --> 00:22:33,477
<font color="white">Madam, it is Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:22:33,560 --> 00:22:34,728
<font color="white">Pardon the intrusion.</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:22:41,610 --> 00:22:43,236
<font color="white">What is that now?</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:22:43,320 --> 00:22:46,615
<font color="white">It was sent by the Lady of the First Rank,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">wife of the Left State Councilor.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

258
00:22:47,574 --> 00:22:48,867
<font color="white">They said it's velvet antler.</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:59,336
<font color="white">It seems the Lady of the First Rank</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has something to say to me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

260
00:23:01,129 --> 00:23:03,006
<font color="white">Find a fitting gift in return.</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:23:04,091 --> 00:23:05,759
<font color="white">If she calls for me, I must go.</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:24,069
<font color="white">Why has it been so long</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">since you last came?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

263
00:23:24,152 --> 00:23:26,655
<font color="white">I was near beside myself with loneliness.</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:23:26,738 --> 00:23:30,242
<font color="white">Forgive me. I should have visited sooner.</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:23:31,076 --> 00:23:32,911
<font color="white">You have been well, I trust?</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:23:32,994 --> 00:23:33,995
<font color="white">I have.</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:23:34,955 --> 00:23:37,958
<font color="white">But you have not, I hear.</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:23:39,209 --> 00:23:40,752
<font color="white">My, my.</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:23:40,836 --> 00:23:44,214
<font color="white">How broad-minded you are, like a man.</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:23:48,301 --> 00:23:51,179
<font color="white">Why ever would you seek out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a concubine yourself?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

271
00:23:55,142 --> 00:23:56,977
<font color="white">You know how thin Bukchon's walls are.</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:23:57,060 --> 00:23:59,271
<font color="white">Nothing stays hidden for long.</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:24:01,022 --> 00:24:02,065
<font color="white">So,</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:24:03,024 --> 00:24:04,860
<font color="white">when will you bring her in?</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:24:05,694 --> 00:24:07,320
<font color="white">I am still searching.</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:24:08,155 --> 00:24:10,157
<font color="white">I cannot bring just anyone in,</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:12,033
<font color="white">so there is much to consider.</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:24:19,166 --> 00:24:20,083
<font color="white">Not long ago,</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:24:21,209 --> 00:24:23,170
<font color="white">Lord Yoo presented my husband</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:24:23,253 --> 00:24:27,090
<font color="white">a great quantity of fine tobacco.</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:24:29,217 --> 00:24:32,387
<font color="white">I thought the Left State Councilor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has given up smoking.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

282
00:24:36,391 --> 00:24:37,267
<font color="white">Do you</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:24:38,685 --> 00:24:40,937
<font color="white">truly know nothing of this?</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:24:43,273 --> 00:24:44,900
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:24:44,983 --> 00:24:46,234
<font color="white">The concubine.</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:24:47,027 --> 00:24:48,904
<font color="white">Has it not already been decided?</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:24:50,739 --> 00:24:53,575
<font color="white">Where else would</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">such fine tobacco come from?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

288
00:24:55,285 --> 00:24:57,537
<font color="white">From Haryanggyo, surely.</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:24:58,663 --> 00:25:00,165
<font color="white">It seems Lord Yoo</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:25:01,041 --> 00:25:05,128
<font color="white">has already visited dozens of times.</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:25:07,547 --> 00:25:09,382
<font color="white">Isn't that why you were planning</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:25:09,966 --> 00:25:12,677
<font color="white">to take in that Tobacco Shop girl</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as his concubine?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

293
00:25:17,057 --> 00:25:18,934
<font color="white">Make way!</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:25:21,478 --> 00:25:23,688
<font color="white">-What is all that, my lady?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Make way!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

295
00:25:24,689 --> 00:25:26,733
<font color="white">Oh, good heavens.</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:25:26,816 --> 00:25:28,485
<font color="white">Anyone would think</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:25:28,568 --> 00:25:32,322
<font color="white">those were betrothal gifts for a wedding.</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:25:36,409 --> 00:25:39,287
<font color="white">-It pays to be of noble blood.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Indeed.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

299
00:25:39,371 --> 00:25:41,248
<font color="white">Look at all the curious things</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he received.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

300
00:25:41,331 --> 00:25:43,333
<font color="white">Where did it all come from, the Qing?</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:25:43,917 --> 00:25:45,293
<font color="white">Watch it, the lady might hear you.</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:25:46,253 --> 00:25:47,462
<font color="white">Whoa, whoa.</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:25:54,678 --> 00:25:56,596
<font color="white">Put your back into it.</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:25:59,391 --> 00:26:00,850
<font color="white">All right, over here!</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:26:00,934 --> 00:26:01,768
<font color="white">What's the matter?</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:26:03,687 --> 00:26:05,188
<font color="white">Handle them carefully.</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:26:06,773 --> 00:26:07,732
<font color="white">Careful, it's valuable.</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:26:10,819 --> 00:26:11,987
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:26:12,570 --> 00:26:14,030
<font color="white">Madam!</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:26:15,824 --> 00:26:18,618
<font color="white">I thought I made myself clear.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You were never to set foot here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

311
00:26:21,162 --> 00:26:22,414
<font color="white">So what is all this?</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:26:22,497 --> 00:26:23,790
<font color="white">Forgive me, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:26:24,332 --> 00:26:25,750
<font color="white">I did hear your words.</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:26:25,834 --> 00:26:29,045
<font color="white">But being an ignorant woman,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I knew no other way</font><font color="white"></font></font>

315
00:26:29,546 --> 00:26:30,463
<font color="white">and came nonetheless.</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:26:30,547 --> 00:26:32,716
<font color="white">I have no grounds to accept these.</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:26:33,633 --> 00:26:35,176
<font color="white">Take them all back with you.</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:26:41,683 --> 00:26:42,600
<font color="white">Madam!</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:26:43,351 --> 00:26:45,687
<font color="white">-Gye-hwa, send her away at once.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, ma'am.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

320
00:26:46,896 --> 00:26:47,731
<font color="white">-Please--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Madam!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

321
00:26:48,648 --> 00:26:52,152
<font color="white">I understand your anger, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:26:52,736 --> 00:26:54,904
<font color="white">How could I not?</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:26:54,988 --> 00:26:56,239
<font color="white">I am a woman too.</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:27:00,452 --> 00:27:01,411
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:27:01,494 --> 00:27:03,913
<font color="white">Madam, I shall never forget</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:27:04,456 --> 00:27:08,084
<font color="white">your kindness in taking my daughter in,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">not till the day I die.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

327
00:27:09,169 --> 00:27:11,046
<font color="white">Had you not taken her under your wing,</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:27:11,129 --> 00:27:14,007
<font color="white">His Lordship would not have come to take</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:27:14,591 --> 00:27:16,134
<font color="white">my So-ok as his concubine.</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:27:22,724 --> 00:27:25,602
<font color="white">If it please you, set the date yourself.</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:27:26,186 --> 00:27:30,231
<font color="white">Until then, I will see that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my girl is properly taught.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

332
00:27:31,649 --> 00:27:33,443
<font color="white">I am most grateful, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:27:53,713 --> 00:27:56,591
<font color="white">All right, then. Like this.</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:27:58,343 --> 00:27:59,427
<font color="white">Let me try now.</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:27:59,511 --> 00:28:02,847
<font color="white">-Like this.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Oh, don't move, my lord!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

336
00:28:02,931 --> 00:28:05,642
<font color="white">All right, all right. Try it like this.</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:28:13,066 --> 00:28:15,026
<font color="white">-Please do it again.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Very well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

338
00:28:15,860 --> 00:28:19,614
<font color="white">Try to do it properly this time. Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:28:26,204 --> 00:28:28,289
<font color="white">Let me see…</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:28:43,388 --> 00:28:46,224
<font color="white">The lady of the Tobacco Shop came by.</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:28:49,102 --> 00:28:51,646
<font color="white">It seems she came unannounced,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">rather impertinently.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

342
00:28:52,689 --> 00:28:54,274
<font color="white">You must have been quite surprised.</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:28:55,358 --> 00:28:56,317
<font color="white">Did you</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:28:57,694 --> 00:28:59,738
<font color="white">find that girl to your liking?</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:29:06,494 --> 00:29:07,328
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:29:08,705 --> 00:29:11,082
<font color="white">I told you I had no wish for it,</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:29:11,166 --> 00:29:13,001
<font color="white">but you would not relent.</font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:29:13,084 --> 00:29:16,171
<font color="white">I only felt sorry</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to leave the burden to you alone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

349
00:29:16,713 --> 00:29:18,965
<font color="white">A concubine is no great matter,</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:29:19,048 --> 00:29:21,050
<font color="white">so I thought</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">someone like her would suffice.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

351
00:29:49,162 --> 00:29:53,166
<font color="white">Madam, a gift has arrived</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the Chief Royal Secretary's house.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

352
00:29:54,125 --> 00:29:59,047
<font color="white">Well, the other ladies</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have also sent small gift boxes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

353
00:29:59,130 --> 00:30:00,465
<font color="white">Shall I bring them in as well?</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:30:08,181 --> 00:30:09,390
<font color="white">Whoa, whoa.</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:30:10,391 --> 00:30:12,227
<font color="white">All right, down now.</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:30:21,611 --> 00:30:24,781
<font color="white">My cousin's aunt is close</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to that woman from the Tobacco Shop,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

357
00:30:25,865 --> 00:30:28,827
<font color="white">and this is what she told me.</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:30:29,244 --> 00:30:30,328
<font color="white">The second daughter,</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:30:31,162 --> 00:30:34,249
<font color="white">who had just come of age,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">went to the Minister's house late at night</font><font color="white"></font></font>

360
00:30:34,332 --> 00:30:35,875
<font color="white">and set her sights on him.</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:30:35,959 --> 00:30:37,877
<font color="white">-How indecent!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Good heavens.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

362
00:30:37,961 --> 00:30:40,755
<font color="white">Some even say</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">they've already heard a baby cry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

363
00:30:40,839 --> 00:30:42,048
<font color="white">The Minister's baby.</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:30:42,131 --> 00:30:44,592
<font color="white">Before me? Surely not.</font><font color="white"></font>

365
00:30:48,054 --> 00:30:49,347
<font color="white">No, what I heard is</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:30:49,430 --> 00:30:53,601
<font color="white">he has been having</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">an improper relationship with the mother.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

367
00:30:53,685 --> 00:30:55,478
<font color="white">Oh, my. Is that true?</font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:30:55,562 --> 00:30:56,729
<font color="white">Surely not.</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:30:57,647 --> 00:30:59,941
<font color="white">The Minister of Rites would never,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with a woman like that.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

370
00:31:00,024 --> 00:31:03,695
<font color="white">Be that as it may,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">there is already a baby, is there not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

371
00:31:03,778 --> 00:31:05,572
<font color="white">But with so many eyes upon them,</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:09,450
<font color="white">his lady feigns generosity, as though</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">seeking him a concubine of her own accord.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

373
00:31:10,285 --> 00:31:13,663
<font color="white">After acting so lofty, like a crane.</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:31:13,746 --> 00:31:16,791
<font color="white">By the by, it has been some time</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">since we sent gifts,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

375
00:31:16,875 --> 00:31:18,334
<font color="white">and still not a word--</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:31:19,878 --> 00:31:20,795
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:31:21,671 --> 00:31:25,758
<font color="white">Your laughter carried</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">all the way to the inner quarters.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

378
00:31:26,467 --> 00:31:29,262
<font color="white">You seemed much amused by your tale.</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:31:29,345 --> 00:31:31,306
<font color="white">Please share it with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:31:31,389 --> 00:31:32,807
<font color="white">I am most curious.</font><font color="white"></font>

381
00:31:33,474 --> 00:31:36,102
<font color="white">We had heard nothing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and wondered when you might arrive.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

382
00:31:38,021 --> 00:31:39,689
<font color="white">The fragrance is most pleasing.</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:31:39,772 --> 00:31:42,108
<font color="white">And the weather is quite lovely.</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:31:52,827 --> 00:31:53,953
<font color="white">Don't I look pretty?</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:31:54,746 --> 00:31:56,623
<font color="white">Aren't I doing well? Look.</font><font color="white"></font>

386
00:31:57,749 --> 00:31:59,542
<font color="white">One, two.</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:32:04,213 --> 00:32:05,131
<font color="white">Mal-ttong!</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:32:18,436 --> 00:32:19,771
<font color="white">No, come here!</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:32:45,046 --> 00:32:47,966
<font color="white">I saw that spring</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">had come in full this morning,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

390
00:32:48,049 --> 00:32:50,093
<font color="white">and wished to bring this to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:32:52,345 --> 00:32:54,222
<font color="white">Did you sleep well through the night?</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:32:55,473 --> 00:32:56,432
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:33:16,369 --> 00:33:17,370
<font color="white">Cho-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:33:23,001 --> 00:33:24,252
<font color="white">Is that a flower?</font><font color="white"></font>

395
00:33:25,545 --> 00:33:26,504
<font color="white">How lovely.</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:33:32,510 --> 00:33:35,805
<font color="white">Did you find its petals so fair?</font><font color="white"></font>

397
00:33:39,434 --> 00:33:41,686
<font color="white">I have before me a spring far lovelier,</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:44,230
<font color="white">so I hardly noticed.</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:33:45,690 --> 00:33:49,068
<font color="white">How do you speak so beautifully?</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:33:51,070 --> 00:33:53,865
<font color="white">Such clear tears, already welling.</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:33:56,743 --> 00:33:59,620
<font color="white">Then again, you are at an age</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when the heart runs wild.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

402
00:34:06,461 --> 00:34:09,172
<font color="white">Very well. Off with you now.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:34:10,673 --> 00:34:11,507
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:34:14,010 --> 00:34:16,012
<font color="white">Thank you, my lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:34:32,570 --> 00:34:35,490
{\an8}<font color="white">MUN-HEUL</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:34:35,573 --> 00:34:36,491
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>"Mun-heul."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:34:37,450 --> 00:34:39,285
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>That is the pen name I have given myself.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:34:40,578 --> 00:34:43,206
<font color="white"><i>Like the moon</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>rising highest in the night sky,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:34:43,790 --> 00:34:46,125
<font color="white"><i>I only hope that my writings,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:34:46,751 --> 00:34:48,377
<font color="white"><i>which may never see the light of day,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:34:48,461 --> 00:34:50,797
<font color="white"><i>might at least rise high in the darkness.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:34:52,215 --> 00:34:55,885
<font color="white"><i>And so, this moment of exchanging letters</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>with you brings me comfort.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:34:56,928 --> 00:34:59,055
<font color="white"><i>From now on,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>I shall write to you under this name.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:35:00,181 --> 00:35:01,265
<font color="white"><i>On that note,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:35:02,183 --> 00:35:05,686
<font color="white"><i>if you are so inclined,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>would you take the name Cho-hui?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

416
00:35:06,896 --> 00:35:08,773
<font color="white"><i>It was Nanseolheon's given name.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:35:10,525 --> 00:35:12,360
<font color="white"><i>On my way back from the village school,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:35:12,443 --> 00:35:13,653
<font color="white"><i>a flower fell</i></font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:35:14,403 --> 00:35:16,155
<font color="white"><i>and came to rest upon my hand.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:35:17,406 --> 00:35:21,202
<font color="white"><i>It felt as though</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>it had been destined for me,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:35:21,702 --> 00:35:24,080
<font color="white"><i>so I held it fast and brought it home.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:35:24,163 --> 00:35:25,915
<font color="white">CHO-HUI</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:35:25,998 --> 00:35:28,209
<font color="white"><i>I entrust my fate to you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:35:28,793 --> 00:35:29,794
<font color="white"><i>Please do not lose it.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:36:13,171 --> 00:36:14,297
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

426
00:36:14,964 --> 00:36:16,465
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won!</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:36:17,717 --> 00:36:18,718
<font color="white">A letter has come!</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:36:24,015 --> 00:36:25,391
<font color="white">I'll leave it here.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:36:25,474 --> 00:36:26,434
<font color="white">How is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:36:34,817 --> 00:36:39,530
<font color="white">They say the Chief State Councilor's wife</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has a pipe near nine </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>cheok</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> long.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

431
00:36:39,614 --> 00:36:43,117
<font color="white">The steward says the pipe is so long</font><font color="white"></font>

432
00:36:43,201 --> 00:36:46,162
<font color="white">the maid must cross</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to the next room just to light it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

433
00:36:47,914 --> 00:36:49,999
<font color="white">"Have you put it in yet?"</font><font color="white"></font>

434
00:36:50,082 --> 00:36:52,960
<font color="white">"Yes, my lady! Keep sucking!"</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:36:53,044 --> 00:36:55,129
<font color="white">-"How nice!"</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-My lord!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

436
00:36:55,671 --> 00:36:59,759
<font color="white">MUN-HEUL</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:37:03,596 --> 00:37:04,430
<font color="white">How nice.</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:37:05,097 --> 00:37:06,307
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:37:06,390 --> 00:37:08,517
<font color="white">Mine has a sour taste.</font><font color="white"></font>

440
00:37:08,601 --> 00:37:10,937
<font color="white">A sharp tang that hits the throat.</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:37:11,520 --> 00:37:12,355
<font color="white">The throat?</font><font color="white"></font>

442
00:37:14,607 --> 00:37:16,192
<font color="white">No, that won't do.</font><font color="white"></font>

443
00:37:16,817 --> 00:37:18,361
<font color="white">Is it that tang</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:37:19,654 --> 00:37:22,531
<font color="white">that pleases you or…</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:37:23,532 --> 00:37:26,118
<font color="white">-Is it like a maiden's first night?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Or…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

446
00:37:29,330 --> 00:37:30,539
<font color="white">Where is it from?</font><font color="white"></font>

447
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:33,542
<font color="white">It has been some time,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I should like to feel it again.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

448
00:37:33,626 --> 00:37:36,504
<font color="white">It's Samdeungcho.</font><font color="white"></font>

449
00:37:36,587 --> 00:37:39,423
<font color="white">I thought the men from that region</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tasted rather sour.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

450
00:37:39,507 --> 00:37:40,424
<font color="white">Enough.</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:37:42,969 --> 00:37:44,512
<font color="white">-All of you, out.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

452
00:37:55,064 --> 00:37:56,482
<font color="white">Cho-hui!</font><font color="white"></font>

453
00:38:10,746 --> 00:38:12,957
<font color="white">MUN-HEUL</font><font color="white"></font>

454
00:38:25,052 --> 00:38:26,679
<font color="white">What brings this on?</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:38:26,762 --> 00:38:28,931
<font color="white">You never eat such things, young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:38:33,477 --> 00:38:36,105
<font color="white"><i>To my cousin, Cho Won.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

457
00:38:38,733 --> 00:38:42,445
<font color="white"><i>Spring has already begun</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to stir in Bukchon,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:38:43,070 --> 00:38:44,947
<font color="white"><i>and my heart follows it.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:38:45,573 --> 00:38:48,451
<font color="white"><i>I find myself missing you all the more.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:38:51,078 --> 00:38:53,039
<font color="white"><i>Have you been well?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:39:10,306 --> 00:39:12,266
<font color="white"><i>I must see you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

462
00:39:12,892 --> 00:39:16,187
<font color="white"><i>Please come to see me at once.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:39:17,688 --> 00:39:20,399
<font color="white"><i>I can no longer bear</i></font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:39:20,900 --> 00:39:23,402
<font color="white"><i>to leave this longing as it is.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:39:30,451 --> 00:39:34,080
<font color="white">Madam, Lord Cho Won is</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">on his way to Hanyang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

466
00:40:22,837 --> 00:40:25,381
<font color="white">It seems all of Joseon has gathered here.</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:40:27,466 --> 00:40:29,343
<font color="white">Good heavens, he will kill him!</font><font color="white"></font>

468
00:40:30,970 --> 00:40:33,556
<font color="white">-Down he goes!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Damn it!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

469
00:40:33,639 --> 00:40:36,350
<font color="white">Won your bet?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Must be in high spirits! Half price!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

470
00:40:36,434 --> 00:40:39,478
<font color="white">Lost your bet?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Sweeten your mood! Half price!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

471
00:40:39,562 --> 00:40:42,731
<font color="white">Sweet, sticky taffy!</font><font color="white"></font>

472
00:40:42,815 --> 00:40:45,276
<font color="white">Here, buy some taffy!</font><font color="white"></font>

473
00:40:45,359 --> 00:40:48,737
<font color="white">-Get your taffy here!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Buy some taffy!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

474
00:40:48,821 --> 00:40:51,866
<font color="white">-Get your taffy!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Why such haste, ladies?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

475
00:40:51,949 --> 00:40:53,659
<font color="white">Come, share a drink with us.</font><font color="white"></font>

476
00:40:53,742 --> 00:40:54,994
<font color="white">Come by later.</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:40:55,995 --> 00:40:57,663
<font color="white">Which fellow is that?</font><font color="white"></font>

478
00:40:57,746 --> 00:40:59,790
<font color="white">So? Which one?</font><font color="white"></font>

479
00:41:00,583 --> 00:41:03,794
<font color="white"><i>This one and that</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>All sorts of lads gather here</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

480
00:41:03,878 --> 00:41:07,173
<font color="white"><i>Then scatter again</i></font><font color="white"></font>

481
00:41:07,256 --> 00:41:09,800
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>This here is</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Hey! Clear off, you brats!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

482
00:41:09,884 --> 00:41:13,220
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Hanyang, the capital</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-What are you doing back here? Go away!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

483
00:41:13,304 --> 00:41:15,097
<font color="white"><i>Cross Gwangtonggyo over Cheonggyecheon</i></font><font color="white"></font>

484
00:41:15,181 --> 00:41:16,807
<font color="white"><i>To the south</i></font><font color="white"></font>

485
00:41:16,891 --> 00:41:19,143
<font color="white"><i>And you come to Namchon</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Where the lowly dwell</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

486
00:41:19,226 --> 00:41:20,102
<font color="white">Hear, hear!</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:41:20,186 --> 00:41:21,353
<font color="white"><i>Cross to the north</i></font><font color="white"></font>

488
00:41:21,437 --> 00:41:23,814
<font color="white"><i>And you come to Bukchon</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Where the high-born reside</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

489
00:41:23,898 --> 00:41:27,151
<font color="white"><i>Bukchon, what a sight it is</i></font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:41:27,234 --> 00:41:30,029
<font color="white">Clear the way!</font><font color="white"></font>

491
00:41:31,155 --> 00:41:34,450
<font color="white">Make way!</font><font color="white"></font>

492
00:41:35,284 --> 00:41:37,453
<font color="white">Clear the way at once!</font><font color="white"></font>

493
00:41:38,704 --> 00:41:40,831
<font color="white">Clear the way at once!</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:41:40,915 --> 00:41:46,462
<font color="white"><i>Palanquins bearing high officials</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>As the bearers' calls ring out</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

495
00:41:46,545 --> 00:41:49,340
<font color="white"><i>Animals scurry to hide</i></font><font color="white"></font>

496
00:41:49,423 --> 00:41:53,135
<font color="white"><i>Birds fold their wings</i></font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:41:53,219 --> 00:41:56,055
<font color="white"><i>Surely this is the finest place</i></font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:41:56,138 --> 00:41:59,975
<font color="white"><i>In all of Hanyang</i></font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:42:00,059 --> 00:42:01,560
<font color="white"><i>Is it not?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

500
00:42:02,102 --> 00:42:04,980
<font color="white"><i>Be that as it may</i></font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:42:05,940 --> 00:42:07,858
<font color="white"><i>This is Bukchon</i></font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:42:25,084 --> 00:42:27,211
<font color="white">I will escort you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to the inner quarters, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

503
00:42:55,489 --> 00:42:56,448
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:42:56,991 --> 00:42:58,784
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won is here.</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:43:06,750 --> 00:43:08,085
<font color="white">Send him in.</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:43:32,693 --> 00:43:34,111
<font color="white"><i>The journey to Hanyang</i></font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:43:34,778 --> 00:43:36,405
<font color="white"><i>seems to have taken you some time.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:43:37,489 --> 00:43:40,159
<font color="white"><i>I had long stayed away,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>thinking I ought not to come here.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:43:41,327 --> 00:43:43,120
<font color="white"><i>Thus, I was unfamiliar with the road.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:43:44,788 --> 00:43:46,332
<font color="white"><i>Have I kept you waiting long?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:43:53,130 --> 00:43:54,673
<font color="white">Have you been well?</font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:43:56,967 --> 00:43:58,636
<font color="white">With the moon rising and setting each day</font><font color="white"></font>

513
00:44:00,220 --> 00:44:03,182
<font color="white">and the flowers blooming in full</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">each passing season,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

514
00:44:04,224 --> 00:44:05,392
<font color="white">I have been</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:44:06,852 --> 00:44:08,145
<font color="white">quite well indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:44:08,812 --> 00:44:09,938
<font color="white">You are as fair</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:44:11,899 --> 00:44:12,733
<font color="white">as ever.</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:44:17,738 --> 00:44:19,031
<font color="white">In truth,</font><font color="white"></font>

519
00:44:19,823 --> 00:44:23,202
<font color="white">I have a favor to ask of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

520
00:44:24,161 --> 00:44:25,079
<font color="white">A favor?</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:44:32,169 --> 00:44:33,796
<font color="white">What could it be,</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:44:33,879 --> 00:44:37,049
<font color="white">that you would break</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">such long silence to write to me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

523
00:44:38,425 --> 00:44:40,427
<font color="white">We have decided to bring in a concubine.</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:44:43,347 --> 00:44:46,225
<font color="white">And so I ask this of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:44:49,895 --> 00:44:51,480
<font color="white">So-ok, who is to be the concubine.</font><font color="white"></font>

526
00:44:52,564 --> 00:44:55,526
<font color="white">Please see that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tender, young bud bears a child.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

527
00:44:58,278 --> 00:44:59,113
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

528
00:45:01,907 --> 00:45:02,950
<font color="white">And if I refuse…</font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:45:05,911 --> 00:45:07,955
<font color="white">will this be the last day I see you?</font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:45:08,997 --> 00:45:11,375
<font color="white">I am always by your side.</font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:45:12,459 --> 00:45:15,003
<font color="white">Was it not you who deemed this</font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:45:15,087 --> 00:45:16,880
<font color="white">a place you must not come?</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:45:17,464 --> 00:45:19,716
<font color="white">-Me?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I hear you have spent your years</font><font color="white"></font></font>

534
00:45:19,800 --> 00:45:22,302
<font color="white">plucking every pretty flower</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">beyond Hanyang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

535
00:45:23,679 --> 00:45:26,056
<font color="white">Then show me, this once,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">how much you have changed.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

536
00:45:26,140 --> 00:45:28,934
<font color="white">The extent of your skill.</font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:45:29,017 --> 00:45:32,104
<font color="white">To display my skill on a naive girl</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:45:33,856 --> 00:45:35,941
<font color="white">who would fall at the lightest touch…</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:45:37,651 --> 00:45:39,820
<font color="white">She'd break at a mere breeze at that age.</font><font color="white"></font>

540
00:45:39,903 --> 00:45:43,615
<font color="white">That is why I ask you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to see that she bears a child.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

541
00:45:53,750 --> 00:45:56,211
<font color="white">The lack of a child</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">between you and your husband…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

542
00:45:59,381 --> 00:46:00,507
<font color="white">Is it his fault then?</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:46:04,136 --> 00:46:05,512
<font color="white">Certainly not.</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:46:06,972 --> 00:46:09,475
<font color="white">What fault could there be in him?</font><font color="white"></font>

545
00:46:09,558 --> 00:46:11,894
<font color="white">The fault is mine. My own lack of virtue.</font><font color="white"></font>

546
00:46:13,687 --> 00:46:15,189
<font color="white">This is how I was taught</font><font color="white"></font>

547
00:46:16,523 --> 00:46:18,901
<font color="white">a woman must behave.</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:46:18,984 --> 00:46:21,945
<font color="white">Keep silent, bow her head,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and serve her husband.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

549
00:46:24,198 --> 00:46:25,240
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:46:26,575 --> 00:46:27,409
<font color="white">But</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:46:27,993 --> 00:46:30,162
<font color="white">why must it be my child?</font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:46:33,540 --> 00:46:35,250
<font color="white">Because I wish to hold…</font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:46:37,961 --> 00:46:40,547
<font color="white">a child that bears your likeness</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in my arms.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

554
00:46:43,425 --> 00:46:46,053
<font color="white">The secret joy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of being with such a child shall be</font><font color="white"></font></font>

555
00:46:47,846 --> 00:46:49,473
<font color="white">the solace of my remaining years.</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:46:57,814 --> 00:46:59,233
<font color="white">Do you still…</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:47:02,236 --> 00:47:03,320
<font color="white">hold me…</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:47:05,364 --> 00:47:07,115
<font color="white">in your heart?</font><font color="white"></font>

559
00:47:13,914 --> 00:47:14,748
<font color="white">Do you?</font><font color="white"></font>

560
00:47:17,668 --> 00:47:18,710
<font color="white">Is that it?</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:51:05,103 --> 00:51:10,108
<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song</font><font color="white"></font>

